          "id": "the_activity_chain_reproduces_the_reference_sho_table",
          "description": "S1-S9, against `sho`, which this snapshot shares byte for byte with thirteen others. activity_rows is day-major over the 41 age categories and this run has one day type, so position 1 is age 0 and position 41 age 40. It was 82 positions with the weekend block first (docs/esm-conventions.md 42).",
